- If dir>0 (increase l): search l in [baseL, 100]. Find minimal l with ratio>=target. If contrast at 100 < target → null.
- If dir<0 (decrease l): search l in [0, baseL]. Find maximal l with ratio>=target. If contrast at 0 < target → null (white bg, black gives 21 so fine).

